{"schema_version":1,"resources":{"locales/kr/ep4/quest_story/14233270.json":{"asset_key":"ep4/quest_story_14233270","episode":"ep4","category":"quest_story","story_id":"14233270","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:0:1423327001:0":{"text":"오로나와 약속한 시간이 되었어요. 은월의 제단으로 찾아가 볼까요?","source_cn":"到了跟欧罗娜约定的时间了，我们去银月祭庭找她吧？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC10BAD0E5F2E5014","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:漫漫":{"text":"해미","source":"漫漫","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":2,"localized_text_count":1,"speaker_count":1}},"locales/kr/ep4/quest_story/14233280.json":{"asset_key":"ep4/quest_story_14233280","episode":"ep4","category":"quest_story","story_id":"14233280","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:0:1423328001:0":{"text":"오로나예요! 준비를 정말 철저하게 했네요.","source_cn":"那是欧罗娜！她好像准备得很充分呢。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4D72512850B22CA3","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:漫漫":{"text":"해미","source":"漫漫","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":2,"localized_text_count":1,"speaker_count":1}},"locales/kr/ep4/quest_story/14233290.json":{"asset_key":"ep4/quest_story_14233290","episode":"ep4","category":"quest_story","story_id":"14233290","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:3:1423329001:1":{"text":"오셨군요! 미리 공부도 좀 하고, 책도 찾아봤어요. 조리도구도 챙겼고... 아무튼 필요할 것 같은 건 다 챙겼어요!","source_cn":"你们来啦！我提前做了一些功课，查阅了书籍，带了炊具……...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xDB3B430653ECC86B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1423329002:1":{"text":"지도를 보니까 달이 지는 승강기에 있는 승강기로 은혜로운 평민 지역에 갈 수 있대요. 이번에는 그쪽 길로 가볼까요?","source_cn":"我看了地图，月落升降井处的升降机可以通往泽被平民区，所...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x51F6CBEF120EFD7D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1423329003:1":{"text":"오로나가 저희를 안내해 줄 것 같아요.","source_cn":"感觉欧罗娜都可以为我们带路了呢。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x37F122EDF1ED6E00","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1423329004:1":{"text":"그 길은 저희도 잘 알아요. 어서 출발해요!","source_cn":"那条路线我们也很熟悉！我们出发吧！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA9A303203FEC8337","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:欧罗娜":{"text":"오로나","source":"欧罗娜","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:漫漫":{"text":"해미","source":"漫漫","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:满满":{"text":"치피","source":"满满","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":5,"localized_text_count":4,"speaker_count":3}},"locales/kr/ep4/quest_story/14233300.json":{"asset_key":"ep4/quest_story_14233300","episode":"ep4","category":"quest_story","story_id":"14233300","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:0:1423330001:0":{"text":"평민들이 여기서 사는 거군요... 진흙투성이에 허름하고, 비도 제대로 못 막는 집들이에요.","source_cn":"这里就是平民生活的地方……泥泞，破败，连遮风挡雨都做不到。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x302FB39F33464E18","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:1:1423330002:0":{"text":"제가 상상한 것보다 더 가슴 아픈 광경이에요...","source_cn":"比我想象的更让人心酸……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x557C150E03FF0E0C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:欧罗娜":{"text":"오로나","source":"欧罗娜","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":3,"localized_text_count":2,"speaker_count":1}},"locales/kr/ep4/quest_story/14233310.json":{"asset_key":"ep4/quest_story_14233310","episode":"ep4","category":"quest_story","story_id":"14233310","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:0:1423331001:0":{"text":"제이미, 시나! 얘들이 어디 간 거지?!","source_cn":"詹米！希娜！……孩子们都去哪了？！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1408276193D39E4C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:平民胡丽诺":{"text":"평민 헤리나","source":"平民胡丽诺","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":2,"localized_text_count":1,"speaker_count":1}},"locales/kr/ep4/quest_story/14233320.json":{"asset_key":"ep4/quest_story_14233320","episode":"ep4","category":"quest_story","story_id":"14233320","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:2:1423332001:1":{"text":"안녕하세요! 아이들 이름을 부르고 계시던데, 무슨 일인가요?","source_cn":"您好！我听到您在叫孩子们的名字，这里的孩子怎么了？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE2D3799EAC5A6E99","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1423332002:1":{"text":"우리 제이미랑 마을 아이들 몇 명이 사라졌어요. 혹시 숲으로 들어간 건 아닐까 걱정되네요.","source_cn":"我的孩子詹米和村里的几个小孩都跑得不见人影，我害怕他们...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xAAE37C8A4DA82A18","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1423332003:1":{"text":"정말이지, 왜 이렇게 걱정을 끼치는지! 어른도 없이 가서 위험해지면 어쩌려고...","source_cn":"真是不让人省心！没有大人在身边，遇到危险可怎么办……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x93B8EEAB0A77AE54","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1423332004:1":{"text":"너무 걱정하지 마세요. 저희도 아이들을 찾아볼게요!","source_cn":"您别着急，我们也来帮忙找孩子们！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x48BEB4EADFD4D48C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:欧罗娜":{"text":"오로나","source":"欧罗娜","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:平民胡丽诺":{"text":"평민 헤리나","source":"平民胡丽诺","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":5,"localized_text_count":4,"speaker_count":2}},"locales/kr/ep4/quest_story/14233340.json":{"asset_key":"ep4/quest_story_14233340","episode":"ep4","category":"quest_story","story_id":"14233340","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:0:1423334001:0":{"text":"울음소리가 들렸어요... 혹시 저쪽에 있는 게 길을 잃어버린 아이일까요?","source_cn":"我听到了哭泣的声音……那个是走丢了的孩子吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xDA5618C17CBB9B2B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:欧罗娜":{"text":"오로나","source":"欧罗娜","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":2,"localized_text_count":1,"speaker_count":1}},"locales/kr/ep4/quest_story/14233350.json":{"asset_key":"ep4/quest_story_14233350","episode":"ep4","category":"quest_story","story_id":"14233350","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:3:1423335001:1":{"text":"꼬마 친구, 왜 여기서 혼자 울고 있나요? 다른 친구들은요? 어른들이 걱정하고 계세요. 얼른 돌아가요.","source_cn":"小朋友，你怎么一个人在这里哭呀？你的朋友呢？大人很担心...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5F91EA36C9B5F5A0","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1423335002:1":{"text":"...흑, 귀신 잡기 놀이를 하고 있었는데, 친구들이 너무 빨리 도망쳐서 금방 사라져 버렸어요. 도저히 따라갈 수 없었다고요!","source_cn":"……呜……我们在玩扮鬼抓人的游戏，可是他们跑得好快，一...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF60CE9526EF26D59","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1423335003:1":{"text":"간신히 주르를 찾았는데 걔도 도망갔고... 못 찾으면 계속 찾아야 한단 말이에요! 그런데 혼자서는 너무 무서워서...","source_cn":"好不容易找到了朱尔，可是朱尔又跑掉了……追不上他们，我...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x688B2873A8B87C65","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1423335004:1":{"text":"저희가 친구들 찾는 걸 도와주면 집에 갈래요?","source_cn":"如果我们帮你找到朋友的话，你是不是就愿意回家了？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xEBBD2661418DBC84","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1423335005:1":{"text":"사실 저도 집에 가고 싶어요. 그런데 혼자서 가면 안될 것 같고, 혼자 갈 수도 없을 거 같아요...","source_cn":"其实我现在就想回家了，只是我不能丢下他们，我也不敢一个...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x05BE3C6AA4B79A4E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:8:1423335005":{"text":"사실 저도 집에 가고 싶어요. 그런데 혼자서 가면 안될 것 같고, 혼자 갈 수도 없을 거 같아요...","source_cn":"其实我现在就想回家了，只是我不能丢下他们，我也不敢一个人回去……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x05BE3C6AA4B79A4E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1423335006:1":{"text":"고맙습니다. 저 혼자서 너무 무서웠어요. 얼른 친구들을 찾아주세요. 같이 돌아가고 싶어요!","source_cn":"谢谢你们，我好害怕一个人，你们快点找到他们，把他们带回来吧！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF609F8AE370301EA","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:8:0:1":{"text":"우리도 같이 놀아줄게","source_cn":"我们也来玩游戏","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x156A5A2D51E4F3D3","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"우리도 같이 놀아줄게","female":"우리도 같이 놀아줄게","variant_male_record_index":"74366","variant_female_record_index":"74367","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:8:1:2":{"text":"우리도 같이 찾아줄게","source_cn":"我们帮你找到他们","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x5E17CA4F31D8A81B","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"우리도 같이 찾아줄게","female":"우리도 같이 찾아줄게","variant_male_record_index":"74368","variant_female_record_index":"74369","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:欧罗娜":{"text":"오로나","source":"欧罗娜","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:詹米":{"text":"제이미","source":"詹米","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:满满":{"text":"치피","source":"满满","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":10,"localized_text_count":9,"speaker_count":3}},"locales/kr/ep4/quest_story/14233360.json":{"asset_key":"ep4/quest_story_14233360","episode":"ep4","category":"quest_story","story_id":"14233360","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:1:1423336001:1":{"text":"제이미, 이거 반칙이야! 어른한테 도와달라고 하면 어떡해!","source_cn":"詹米，你也太耍赖了，怎么能找大人当外援呢！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x370BE8B8DAADA25D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1423336002:1":{"text":"혼자서는 계속 못 찾았으니까 그렇지... 나 집에 갈래...","source_cn":"因为我一直找不到你们嘛……我想回家了……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA4802A96ACEF1F19","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1423336003:1":{"text":"집? 하지만 아직 안 끝났잖아. 주르도 못 찾았으면서!","source_cn":"回家？可是你还没有赢呢，你还差朱尔没有找到。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4519442C665EA1CE","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1423336004:1":{"text":"여긴 몇 번이나 찾아봤는데... 설마 주르가 더 남쪽으로 간 걸까요?","source_cn":"我们已经把这里都找遍了呀……难道朱尔躲在了南边更远的地方？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x44C99BC50900A1F5","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1423336005:1":{"text":"엄마가 거긴 위험하다고 했어요. 얼른 주르를 찾아야 해요!","source_cn":"妈妈说过，那里是很危险的，我们赶紧找到他吧！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x62ED34A2066992F9","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:希娜":{"text":"시나","source":"希娜","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:詹米":{"text":"제이미","source":"詹米","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:漫漫":{"text":"해미","source":"漫漫","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":6,"localized_text_count":5,"speaker_count":3}},"locales/kr/ep4/quest_story/14233370.json":{"asset_key":"ep4/quest_story_14233370","episode":"ep4","category":"quest_story","story_id":"14233370","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:0:1423337001:0":{"text":"주르를 찾은 거 아냐? 다른 사람이랑도 같이 있네!","source_cn":"朱尔已经被找到了？居然还有外援！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5249DF55D43D10E6","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:1:1423337002:0":{"text":"저건 다른 사람이 아니라 팬텀 포자 버섯이에요. 얼른 도와줘야 해요!","source_cn":"那不是外援，是幻灵孢菇！快去帮忙！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1DFF9E7B82CF3C79","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:希娜":{"text":"시나","source":"希娜","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:漫漫":{"text":"해미","source":"漫漫","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":3,"localized_text_count":2,"speaker_count":2}},"locales/kr/ep4/quest_story/14233380.json":{"asset_key":"ep4/quest_story_14233380","episode":"ep4","category":"quest_story","story_id":"14233380","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:1:1423338001:1":{"text":"자, 이제 모두 찾았네요. 숨바꼭질도 무사히 끝났어요. 이제 다 같이 집에 가요!","source_cn":"好啦，这下所有的人都被找到了，捉迷藏游戏顺利完成！大家...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x565C71421934B329","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1423338002:1":{"text":"집이요? 싫어요! 아직 더 놀고 싶은데요!","source_cn":"回家？不！我们还没玩够呢！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x023AF12C80DAFC90","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1423338003:1":{"text":"제이미, 어른을 불러오는 건 반칙이야! 이 겁쟁이!","source_cn":"詹米找大人来当外援，詹米犯规！詹米是胆小鬼！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB6E2397FA6706CD1","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1423338004:1":{"text":"찾으면 집에 간다고 약속 안 했거든요! 그건 제이미 혼자서 한 약속이잖아요. 그러니까 저흰 계속 놀 거예요. 계속, 계속!","source_cn":"我可没有答应被找到之后要回家，一定是詹米答应的！我们还...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8F2C3B0F170BD7B3","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1423338005:1":{"text":"방금 팬텀 포자 버섯에게 잡힐 뻔했으면서 아직도 여기서 놀고 싶은 거예요?","source_cn":"你刚刚都差点被幻灵孢菇攻击了，还要待在这里吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x317738B6C9C052AB","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1423338006:1":{"text":"그건 실수였잖아요! 다음번에는 그렇게 외진 곳에 안 숨으면 되구...","source_cn":"那只是个意外！大不了我下次藏在不那么偏僻的地方嘛……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD0F89818F8D78CD0","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1423338007:1":{"text":"여러분도 이제 어린이는 아니잖아요. 물론 마음껏 놀아도 되지만, 때와 장소를 가리지 않고 장난치는 건 안 돼요...","source_cn":"你们这么大的年纪，虽然可以尽情享受游戏的乐趣，但也不能...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xFABE9BD1E0CF2AEF","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1423338008:1":{"text":"가끔은 차분히 앉아서 책도 보고, 뭔가 배우기도 해야죠...","source_cn":"也该抽时间安静下来，读一些书，学点东西……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xBE698E2127D601B6","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1423338009:1":{"text":"무슨 말인지 하나도 못 알아듣겠는데요!","source_cn":"她说的是什么意思啊？我听不懂！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC25FDA5292070ABA","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:14:1423338010:1":{"text":"어쨌든 저희가 성공하는 길은 귀족의 하인이 되는 것뿐이잖아요. 그런 거 배워서 뭐에 써요?","source_cn":"反正我们长大后最好的出路不过是去当贵族的仆从，学你说的...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC9B5C0B76D3087A9","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:15:1423338011:1":{"text":"하인이요? 하지만 왕성은 이미...","source_cn":"仆从？可是现在王城已经……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x82DDA96A4F03BA0A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:16:1423338012:1":{"text":"어쨌든 제이미는 있는 집 애라고요. 제이미나 데리고 가세요. 우린 여기서 더 놀 테니까 신경쓰지 말라고요!","source_cn":"总之，詹米是有家的孩子，詹米回家就好，我们更愿意待在这...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x76AB89BE55B7DA27","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:欧罗娜":{"text":"오로나","source":"欧罗娜","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:莱妮":{"text":"라이니","source":"莱妮","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:希娜":{"text":"시나","source":"希娜","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:朱尔":{"text":"주르","source":"朱尔","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:漫漫":{"text":"해미","source":"漫漫","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":13,"localized_text_count":12,"speaker_count":5}},"locales/kr/ep4/quest_story/14233390.json":{"asset_key":"ep4/quest_story_14233390","episode":"ep4","category":"quest_story","story_id":"14233390","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:0:1423339001:0":{"text":"아이들이 또 다 도망갔어요!","source_cn":"这些孩子们又都跑掉了！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x0F5FC71B87C9B49A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:1:1423339002:0":{"text":"하나라도 데리고 가요... 제이미, 가요.","source_cn":"能带回去一个算一个……詹米，我们走吧。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x43FAD85698A32CD4","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:满满":{"text":"치피","source":"满满","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:欧罗娜":{"text":"오로나","source":"欧罗娜","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":3,"localized_text_count":2,"speaker_count":2}},"locales/kr/ep4/quest_story/14233400.json":{"asset_key":"ep4/quest_story_14233400","episode":"ep4","category":"quest_story","story_id":"14233400","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:1:1423340001:1":{"text":"제이미, 무슨 일은 없었어?","source_cn":"詹米，你没出什么事吧！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x09634E854622F92F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1423340002:1":{"text":"엄마! 난 괜찮아! 시나랑 다른 애들이랑 같이 숨바꼭질 하고 있었어.","source_cn":"妈妈，我没事！我只是跟希娜他们去玩捉迷藏了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC1EAAAF5596F4DCE","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1423340003:1":{"text":"제이미를 데려와주셔서 정말 고맙습니다... 시나는요? 다른 친구들은 안 왔나요?","source_cn":"多谢你们这些好心人带詹米回来……希娜他们呢，没有回来吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x6B3CC976B89DE1A8","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1423340004:1":{"text":"죄송해요. 다른 아이들은 더 놀겠다고 해서 못 데려왔어요...","source_cn":"抱歉，他们还想继续玩游戏，没有回来……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xCFE6F1A4A86D6B1D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1423340005:1":{"text":"아휴, 정말 속 썩이는 애들이라니까...","source_cn":"唉，真是让人不省心的孩子啊。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x738C8F7010B0381A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1423340006:1":{"text":"그 아이들의 상황을... 들려주실 수 있나요?","source_cn":"那几个孩子的情况……可以跟我们说说吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x34AFFFCA326237FC","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1423340007:1":{"text":"...그 애들은 전부 부모 없이 자란 고아들이에요. 산이며 들을 쏘다니면서 사는 애들이라 이웃들이 가끔씩 돌봐주곤 했어요.","source_cn":"……他们都是无父无母的孤儿，从小在山野里摸爬滚生存，我...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x0C7495B4E1E99081","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1423340008:1":{"text":"그 무리의 대장은 시나라고 하는 아이예요. 시나의 어머니는 그 애를 낳고 왕성의 하인으로 들어간 뒤에 돌아오지 않았지요...","source_cn":"那个领头的女孩叫希娜。希娜的母亲在生下希娜后去王城当了...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5790AEFACC2B6CC9","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1423340009:1":{"text":"시나는 대담하고 재빨라서 아이들의 대장을 맡고 있죠. 솔직히, 그 애들은 시나의 말 밖에 듣지 않아요.","source_cn":"希娜胆子大，又身手矫健，如今是这些孩子的头儿，可以说，...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA64B7EB4A0C8BEF6","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1423340010:1":{"text":"하지만 시나는 고집이 센 건지 반항심이 강한 건지, 늘 어른들의 말을 듣지 않더군요. 항상 저렇게 놀면서... 걱정은 되지만 어쩔 수가 없어요.","source_cn":"但希娜，该说是执拗还是叛逆呢？总是跟大人们对着干。这些...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5BC8AE41F7215290","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1423340011:1":{"text":"아이들이 커서 귀족의 하인이 되겠다고 했어요... 하지만 이제 귀족이나 평민, 하인에도 구분이 없는데...","source_cn":"那些孩子还提到长大后去做贵族的仆从……可是现在已经没有...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x43EA2B2E17CD21BE","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:14:1423340012:1":{"text":"원한다면 자유롭게 왕성으로 가서 자기 꿈을 펼칠 수 있어요.","source_cn":"如果他们想的话，他们可以自由前往王城，靠一技之长谋生。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x7F877561507E6721","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:15:1423340013:1":{"text":"아무도 아이들에게 그런 변화를 알려주지 않은 거겠죠...","source_cn":"我想根本没有人告诉他们这些变化吧……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB7934C6FAF09B620","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:16:1423340014:1":{"text":"그런 변화는... 우리 어른들도 어떻게 해야 할 지 모르겠는데, 아이들은 말할 것도 없을 거고요.","source_cn":"对于这些变化，我们大人都不知道该做些什么，该往哪走……...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x28C4AA22982FE47F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:17:1423340015:1":{"text":"이 아이들... 혹시 평민 지역에 이 아이들을 가르쳐줄 학교나 선생님은 없나요?","source_cn":"这些孩子……平民区没有学校和老师愿意接收他们，让他们学习吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x43EC3111FF89ACCE","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:18:1423340016:1":{"text":"학교, 선생님... 그런 건 제사장 귀족들 같은 돈 많은 사람들이나 가질 수 있는 거예요. 저희 평민들은 애초에 바랄 수도 없는 거고요.","source_cn":"学校、老师……这些都是祭司贵族之类的富裕人家才能负担得...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x7EC87C0041767A4B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:19:1423340017:1":{"text":"게다가 여기에 오겠다는 선생님도 없을 거예요...","source_cn":"而且，不会有老师愿意来这里的……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x22E694962049AEEC","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:20:1423340018:1":{"text":"그런 거였군요...","source_cn":"原来是这样……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x75901F66C2633FA4","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"narration:21:1423340019:0":{"text":"아이들 사정을 알고 나니 분위기가 한층 무거워졌다...","source_cn":"知道了这些孩子的真实情况后，气氛一时有些凝重……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xCEAF2C027FD684A8","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:23:1423340020:1":{"text":"...죄송해요. 지금 당장은 도와드릴 수 있는 게 없겠어요. 시간도 늦었으니 오로나를 데리고 돌아갈까요?","source_cn":"……抱歉，我们目前还帮不上什么忙……时间不早了，我们送...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x98B85A68E3F69865","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:24:1423340020":{"text":"...죄송해요. 지금 당장은 도와드릴 수 있는 게 없겠어요. 시간도 늦었으니 오로나를 데리고 돌아갈까요?","source_cn":"……抱歉，我们目前还帮不上什么忙……时间不早了，我们送欧罗娜回去吧？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x98B85A68E3F69865","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:25:1423340021:3":{"text":"제이미, 잘 있어요. 또 만날 수 있으면 좋겠네요!","source_cn":"詹米，再见啦，希望我们还能再见到你！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1577EF3E38703E8C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:26:1423340022:1":{"text":"안녕히 가세요. 집에 데려다 주셔서 고맙습니다!","source_cn":"再见……谢谢你们带詹米回家！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x89F2432739DDB808","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:27:1423340023:1":{"text":"...아, 이거 선물로 줄게요.","source_cn":"……对了！这个送给你！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x012511EB9B05EBD5","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:28:1423340024:1":{"text":"책이에요! 안에 재미있는 이야기가 많이 적혀 있어요!","source_cn":"这个是一本书哦！上面写了很多有趣的事情呢！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA30D585E1FC7A53C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:29:1423340025:1":{"text":"심심할 때 읽어도 좋고, 친구들이랑 같이 읽어도 좋아요!","source_cn":"你无聊的时候可以多读读看！也可以和你的朋友们一起读！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x7A66797AF88AD0C2","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:30:1423340026:1":{"text":"이건... 책이네요? 고마워요, 누나.","source_cn":"这是……书吗？谢谢你，大姐姐……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4A74562479082AF7","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:24:0:1":{"text":"제이미에게 인사라도 하자","source_cn":"跟詹米打个招呼吧","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x290EAFF56DD73EE5","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"제이미에게 인사라도 하자","female":"제이미에게 인사라도 하자","variant_male_record_index":"74370","variant_female_record_index":"74371","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:24:1:2":{"text":"제이미에게 작별 인사라도 하자","source_cn":"跟詹米告个别吧","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0xBEAC553C0413FD2A","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"제이미에게 작별 인사라도 하자","female":"제이미에게 작별 인사라도 하자","variant_male_record_index":"74372","variant_female_record_index":"74373","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:平民胡丽诺":{"text":"평민 헤리나","source":"平民胡丽诺","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:詹米":{"text":"제이미","source":"詹米","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:漫漫":{"text":"해미","source":"漫漫","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:欧罗娜":{"text":"오로나","source":"欧罗娜","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:黑屏字幕":{"text":"블랙 스크린 자막","source":"黑屏字幕","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":30,"localized_text_count":29,"speaker_count":5}},"locales/kr/ep4/quest_story/14233410.json":{"asset_key":"ep4/quest_story_14233410","episode":"ep4","category":"quest_story","story_id":"14233410","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:0:1423341001:0":{"text":"많은 일이 있었으니 오로나도 피곤할 거예요. 왕성으로 돌아가요.","source_cn":"发生了不少事，欧罗娜也累了吧？我们先回王城吧。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA784E5C940843A86","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:漫漫":{"text":"해미","source":"漫漫","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":2,"localized_text_count":1,"speaker_count":1}},"locales/kr/ep4/quest_story/14233420.json":{"asset_key":"ep4/quest_story_14233420","episode":"ep4","category":"quest_story","story_id":"14233420","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:2:1423342001:1":{"text":"오로나, 기분이 조금 가라앉은 것 같아요...","source_cn":"欧罗娜，你看起来心情有点低落……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x196458F61E00E44B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:3:1423342001":{"text":"오로나, 기분이 조금 가라앉은 것 같아요...","source_cn":"欧罗娜，你看起来心情有点低落……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x196458F61E00E44B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1423342002:1":{"text":"아마 그 아이들이 저랑 닮았다고 생각했기 때문일 거예요...","source_cn":"可能因为我觉得那些孩子和我很像吧……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1D2420B9DEBF5830","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1423342003:1":{"text":"예전의 저는 제사장이 되겠다는 생각만 가지고 있었어요. 막막할 때마다 억지로 책을 읽었고, 그러고 있다 보면 걱정을 잠시나마 잊을 수 있었죠...","source_cn":"以前的我只有努力成为祭司这一个念头，迷茫的时候都会逼自...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8361A6CC2866B70B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1423342004:1":{"text":"그런데 이제 제사장이 되기 위해서 배웠던 것을 전부 내려놓고 다시 시작하려고 하니까... 아무 것도 못할 것 같다는 기분이 들어요.","source_cn":"现在要抛弃作为祭司学到的一切重新开始……却发现自己什么...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9E08BEF98D2BDB83","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1423342005:1":{"text":"...막막하고, 갈 곳도 없고, 미래에 뭘 해야 할지 모르겠고, 변화에 맞설 준비가 안 된 것 같고... 그 아이들도 똑같이 느끼는 게 아닐까요?","source_cn":"……迷茫，无处可去，不知道未来该做什么，觉得自己没有准...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x24AEF2489BA69009","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1423342006:1":{"text":"하지만 저는 여러분을 만나서 평민 지역에 가 볼 용기가 생겼고, 첫걸음을 내디딜 수 있는 도움을 받았어요. 하지만 아이들은... 그런 운이 없었던 모양이에요.","source_cn":"但我起码遇到了你们，你们帮助我实现了去平民区看看的愿望...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x7B54F2DFAA0618B1","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:9:1423342006":{"text":"하지만 저는 여러분을 만나서 평민 지역에 가 볼 용기가 생겼고, 첫걸음을 내디딜 수 있는 도움을 받았어요. 하지만 아이들은... 그런 운이 없었던 모양이에요.","source_cn":"但我起码遇到了你们，你们帮助我实现了去平民区看看的愿望，还鼓励我迈出第一步，可那些孩子却没有这样的运气……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x7B54F2DFAA0618B1","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1423342007:1":{"text":"하지만 아직 제 앞날도 확실하지 않은데... 너무 주제넘는 건 아닐까요?","source_cn":"可是我连自己的未来都没有想明白……我是不是太不自量力了？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB410A5207A8CB42C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1423342008:1":{"text":"오로나는 이미 충분히 열심히 하고 있잖아요! 그래도 아직 기분이 안 풀린다면, 다음 번에 다른 곳으로 기분 전환을 하러 갈까요?","source_cn":"欧罗娜你已经很努力了！如果你还是不开心的话，不如我们下...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD3DCD5E180850AE8","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1423342009:1":{"text":"이렇게 계속 도망다니는 건 아닌 것 같아요...","source_cn":"这样逃避下去总不是办法……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xCBC6CA51F36F746F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1423342010:1":{"text":"고마워요! 저도 혼자서 좀 더 생각해 볼게요. 제 미래에 대해서...","source_cn":"谢谢你们！我想一个人好好思考一下，关于未来的事……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB33A5462ED5AE34C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:9:0:1":{"text":"네가 도와줄 방법을 찾아봐도 돼","source_cn":"你可以想办法帮帮他们","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0xF6C7E75633502AA5","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"네가 도와줄 방법을 찾아봐도 돼","female":"네가 도와줄 방법을 찾아봐도 돼","variant_male_record_index":"74376","variant_female_record_index":"74377","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:9:1:2":{"text":"네가 할 수 있는 작은 일부터 시작해도 돼","source_cn":"可以做些能帮到他们的小事","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0xC7D9702CC66182F3","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"네가 할 수 있는 작은 일부터 시작해도 돼","female":"네가 할 수 있는 작은 일부터 시작해도 돼","variant_male_record_index":"74378","variant_female_record_index":"74379","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:3:0:1":{"text":"오로나가 왜 제이미에게 책을 선물로 줬을까?","source_cn":"欧罗娜为什么把书送给了詹米？","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x7CBFBABB907DF02F","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"오로나가 왜 제이미에게 책을 선물로 줬을까?","female":"오로나가 왜 제이미에게 책을 선물로 줬을까?","variant_male_record_index":"74374","variant_female_record_index":"74375","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:满满":{"text":"치피","source":"满满","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speak